        <h2 style="font-size: 24pt; margin-top: 40px; margin-bottom: 10px;">5 Product overview</h2>
        <p style="font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.5;">The ABB MBC is used in conjunction with an Uninterruptible Power Supply (UPS) to maintain total continuity of power to connected load circuits when bypass of the UPS equipment is required for performance of regular service and maintenance.</p>
        <p style="font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.5;">The MBCs are available with power capacities ranging from <span data-field="power_range_min">{{ power_range_min }}</span> to <span data-field="power_range_max">{{ power_range_max }}</span>. The units are also available with multiple input voltage options.</p>

        <h3 style="font-size: 18pt; margin-top: 25px; margin-bottom: 10px;">5.1 Description</h3>
        <!-- Placeholder for Figure 5-1 -->
        <div style="text-align: center; margin: 40px 0;">
            <img src="placeholder_figure_5-1.png" alt="Figure 5-1 Dimensions" style="max-width: 80%; height: auto;">
